    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of timeless art with a playful twist! <i>Cats of Mona Lisa</i> is a relaxing hidden-object game where you explore beautifully reimagined classical paintings in search of ten mischievous cats cleverly hidden within each masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every painting comes alive with vibrant details, as you zoom in and scan each brushstroke for a flick of a tail or the glint of curious eyes. These feline stowaways have blended seamlessly into the art, testing your observation skills and rewarding your persistence with satisfying discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Paintings, Reimagined:</strong> Discover iconic artworks transformed with a whimsical twist as you hunt for hidden cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten Cats in Every Painting:</strong> Each level challenges you to find all ten felines, each hiding in clever and unexpected places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy a no-pressure, calming experience that lets you unwind and immerse yourself in art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Tools:</strong> Use zoom and hint features to examine every detail of the paintings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game for All Ages:</strong> Simple mechanics make it fun for everyone, whether you're a casual gamer or a hidden-object enthusiast.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of timeless art with a playful twist! <i>Cats of Mona Lisa</i> is a relaxing hidden-object game where you explore beautifully reimagined classical paintings in search of ten mischievous cats cleverly hidden within each masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every painting comes alive with vibrant details, as you zoom in and scan each brushstroke for a flick of a tail or the glint of curious eyes. These feline stowaways have blended seamlessly into the art, testing your observation skills and rewarding your persistence with satisfying discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Paintings, Reimagined:</strong> Discover iconic artworks transformed with a whimsical twist as you hunt for hidden cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten Cats in Every Painting:</strong> Each level challenges you to find all ten felines, each hiding in clever and unexpected places.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy a no-pressure, calming experience that lets you unwind and immerse yourself in art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Tools:</strong> Use zoom and hint features to examine every detail of the paintings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game for All Ages:</strong> Simple mechanics make it fun for everyone, whether you're a casual gamer or a hidden-object enthusiast.</p></li></ul>",
